{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Baeshra softly strokes Web's head while looking around, not quite tired yet. \"We make it Web. Row Kanok. The New World.\"  She sighs softly, filled with mixed feelings. Excitement about the long voyage finally ending, loss over losing all her possessions, elation about all of her tribe surviving, curious as to what the woods may have to hunt, confusion on the large creature at the beach could it really be Grimmlock, but most importantly love, as he held the person dearest to her in her arms while they slept. She stays awake, watching. Not vigilant, the fears of the past few days are gone. Just watching. As the sky begins to dawn on a new day.","created_at":"2020-08-01T10:05:35.509000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739061260129271839","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
