{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Rockman runs up to him. His blue armor shining brightly in the sun. His red mechanical dog trotting beside him. He stops steps away. \"It's nice to meet you Traxim! My creator noted that you would be someone for me to go to if I need fixin'! \" he smiles and the red mechanical dog runs around playfully.","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:25:28.221000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739202158175453267","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"He wondered who their creator was but was okay with never finding out. “Certainly, repairs are one of my favorite things to do. Were you on the sub with us?”","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:28:40.897000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739202966317301860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"No... I was built there though\" ... He smiles, \"My name is Rockman!\" The mechanical dog goes to sniff Traxim's feet. \"And this is Rush!\" Rush barks.","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:30:04.667000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-01T19:31:35.267000Z","id":"739203317674016870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“It is a pleasure to meet you, Rockman and Rush.” He was even more curious about the creator knowing that they had been on the sub. There were very few people with the talent amongst the crew and passengers.","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:32:55.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739204035588128830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"So i don't exactly know what to do here.\" Rush sits. \"I was told my creator is gone and just have no idea what I can do to help people out\".","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:36:51.824000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739205025414381600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“Gone? That is a shame.” That narrowed it down. “There is much to do to build up the colony. We must all come together to get an economy going that will allow us to be self sufficient since help from outside seems unlikely.” He paused for a moment. “You should find work you enjoy. I’m starting a business to craft items to help the colonists if you’d like to try giving me a hand.”","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:40:59.808000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739206065534795876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"He extends his arm towards Traxim and gives him a thumbs up! With a large smile ....\"you betcha!\" Rush barks and runs around.","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:42:56.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739206553340477540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“That would be great. Hopefully we can help prevent the loss of anyone else.” They had faced so much every step of the way to the island, it would be a nice break if everybody survived from here on out.","created_at":"2020-08-01T19:45:42.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739207252195672166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
